---
const title = "About PromptVibe HQ";
const description = "Learn about PromptVibe HQ, a library of practical AI prompts and guides.";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title} | PromptVibe HQ</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.promptvibehq.com/about" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
      body{background:#0e0e0e;color:#e0e0e0;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
      .container{max-width:900px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
      header{border-bottom:1px solid #262626;background:rgba(14,14,14,.94);height:80px;display:flex;align-items:center}
      .header-content{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px}
      .logo{font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
      .dot{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;margin-right:8px}
      nav{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
      nav a,footer a{color:#a3a3a3;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}
      nav a:hover,footer a:hover{color:#fff}
      main{flex:1;padding-top:58px;padding-bottom:48px}
      .eyebrow{color:#22c55e;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:14px}
      h1,h2{font-family:'Newsreader',serif;color:#fff}
      h1{font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,48px);line-height:1.12;margin-bottom:20px}
      .lead{font-size:18px;line-height:1.8;color:#bdbdbd;margin-bottom:34px}
      .panel{background:#151515;border:1px solid #292929;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;margin:22px 0}
      h2{font-size:25px;margin-bottom:14px}
      p,li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.85;color:#bdbdbd}
      p+p{margin-top:14px}
      ul{padding-left:22px;margin-top:12px}
      li+li{margin-top:8px}
      a.inline{color:#22c55e}
      footer{border-top:1px solid #262626;padding:30px 0;text-align:center;color:#737373;font-size:12px}
      .footer-links{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}
      @media(max-width:640px){header{height:auto;padding:20px 0}.header-content{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}nav{gap:14px}main{padding-top:38px}.panel{padding:22px}}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container header-content">
        <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="dot"></span>PromptVibe <span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#a3a3a3">HQ</span></a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a><a href="/about" aria-current="page">About</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div>
      <h1>Practical prompts. Clear guidance.</h1>
      <p class="lead">PromptVibe HQ is a growing library of AI prompts and practical guides designed to help people get started with common writing, research, marketing, coding, and creative tasks.</p>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
        <p>We publish reusable prompt examples, explain what each prompt is intended to do, and provide basic instructions for adapting it to a specific task. Our aim is to make prompt writing easier to understand and use, whether you are experimenting with AI tools or building a repeatable workflow.</p>
        <p>Prompts are starting points, not guaranteed solutions. Results can vary depending on the AI model, the information you provide, and the way a tool interprets your request. Always review generated material before relying on it or publishing it.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>How we approach content</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We organize prompts by topic so visitors can find relevant examples more easily.</li>
          <li>We aim to provide clear instructions and context instead of presenting a prompt without explanation.</li>
          <li>We may revise pages to improve clarity, usefulness, accuracy, or the visitor experience.</li>
          <li>We encourage visitors to adapt prompts to their own goals and independently verify important outputs.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Independence and limitations</h2>
        <p>PromptVibe HQ is an independent resource. Unless a page explicitly says otherwise, we are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the AI tools or companies mentioned on this website. Product names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p>
        <p>Content on this website is provided for general informational and educational purposes. It is not professional, legal, financial, medical, or other specialist advice. You are responsible for checking AI-generated results and deciding whether they are suitable for your use.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Get in touch</h2>
        <p>Found an error, have a suggestion, or want to ask a question about the website? Contact us at <a class="inline" href="mailto:support@promptvibehq.com">support@promptvibehq.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="footer-links"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a></div>
        <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} PromptVibe HQ. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
